    {
      "text": "The RapidPro logo: a small blue square icon beside the wordmark 'RapidPro'. It represents one of the three component technologies, an open source interactive messaging platform, shown as part of Fig. 5.6.2 illustrating how mHero integrates digital health interventions using standards.",
